mastery.question_text:
Sketch the inverse of the restricted function shown on the same axes. Label its endpoint and intercepts.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.6cm,y=0.6cm,every node/.style={font=\normalsize}]
\draw[->] (-2,0)--(7,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-2)--(0,7) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[dashed] (-2,-2)--(7,7);
